  "prefLabel": "Tax 301.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 301.01 Applicability. Tax 301 shall apply to the procedures to be followed and established by the board and municipalities in establishing the notice of tax date.\n\nSource. #5638, eff 9-1-93; ss by #7068, INTERIM, eff 8-15-99, EXPIRES, 12-13-99; ss by #7153, eff 12-10-99; ss by #8988, eff 9-24-07; ss by #9539, eff 9-8-09; ss by #10626, eff 6-26-14; ss by #13688, eff 7-19-23",
